<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Verxa Verification Code</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f5f7fb;
            color: #111827;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 32px 16px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            padding: 28px 32px 12px;
        }

        .brand {
            margin: 0;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 12px 32px 32px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1.3;
            color: #111827;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .code {
            margin: 24px 0;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #dbe3ef;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 34px;
            line-height: 1;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .note {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 20px 32px 28px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            background: #fbfdff;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <p class="brand">Verxa</p>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <h1>Your verification code</h1>
                <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>
                <p>Use the code below to complete your verification. This code expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes.</p>
                <div class="code">{{otp}}</div>
                <p class="note">If you did not request this code, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p>Need help? Contact us at {{supportEmail}}.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
